  "resume": "This document is the official protocol of a debate in the Swiss Council of States on June 3, 2014, concerning a parliamentary initiative to include apprenticeship training as a criterion in public procurement. It records speeches by several members of the Council of States on this legislative proposal. The record is part of the official parliamentary documentation of the Swiss federal government."
 },
